  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical Outreach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are going to continue our medical outreach to our community. We are offering free testing, medical examination, and treatment to 100 members of our community. Many people in our community are too poor to get medical treatment from health facilities; hence we are lending a helping hand to this set of people. Some will be given instant treatment, while others will be referred to a specialist, and the cost of treatment will be taken care of by us.</narrative>
  </description>
